    <article class="article-wrapper sportfile">
        <h1 class="article-headline">Baseball Camps</h1>
        
        
        <p class="article-subheadline">Baseball Camps</p>
        <p class="article-byline">
        
        <div class="article-content">
            <h2><em><u>BASEBALL CAMP IN ROCKFORD, ILLINOIS</u></em></h2>
Baseball Winter ID Camp - Get in front of Rock Valley College Coaches. Players have been signed out of this camp in recent years!<br>
January 25, 2026<br>
<br>
Position Camp: 5-7 PM<br>
Pitchers Camp: 7-9 PM<br>
<br>
Register Here (Can Pay Online or Bring Cash/Check) : <a href="http://GoldenEagleBallWinterID.eventbrite.com">GoldenEagleBallWinterID.eventbrite.com</a><br>
PRICING<br>
$75.00 per camp<br>
$100.00 to register for both camps (meaning you are a 2-way and looking to pitch and defend it)<br>
If bringing Cash/Check register through Chad Herren at c.herren@rockvalleycollege.edu<br>
<br>
About the Camp<br>
For 2026-2029 GRADS<br>
<br>
<img alt="" src="data:image/png;base64," style="display: inline-block;"><br>
<br>
<br>
 
<div style="page-break-after: always"><span style="display: none;"> </span></div>
 

<h3>CAMP DATES</h3>

<p>The objective for our 2025 Spring Training Program is to give each player a championship experience over the four days of camp. Players will learn useful information teaching proper mechanics, techniques, and set up drills to use at home for personal skill development. The camp dates are as follows: </p>

<p align="left">Week 1: Sunday, January 12<br>
Week 2: Sunday, January 19<br>
Week 3: Sunday, January 26<br>
Week 4: Sunday, February 2</p>

<h3>PRICING</h3>

<p>One skill session: Four weeks, Six Hours of Instruction - $159<br>
Two skill sessions: Four weeks, Twelve Hours of Instruction - $298 (Save $20)<br>
Three skill sessions: Four weeks, Eighteen Hours of Instruction - $417 (Save $60)<br>
<br>
<a href="https://app.usbaseballacademy.com/camps/rockford-illinois-camp/register">Rock Valley College | Rockford (usbaseballacademy.com)</a></p>
<br>
For any further questions, don't hesitate to reach out to Chad Herren c.herren@rockvalleycollege.edu<br>
<img alt="" data-airgap-id="70" src="data:image/png;base64," style="display: inline-block;"><br>
<br>
<em>Chad Herren <br>
Head Baseball Coach <br>
Phone: (815) 921-3820 <br>
Email: <a href="mailto:c.herren@rockvalleycollege.edu" target="_blank">c.herren@rockvalleycollege.edu</a> <br>
Twitter: <a href="http://twitter.com/herrenc" target="_blank">herrenc</a></em><br>
 <br>
 <br>
<br>
 
        </div>
    </article>


		
